    "description": "<p>A portable scanning device, the Sensor Pack is a bulky rectangle featuring a variety of dials and switches, a readout display, and a scanning dish. It provides general details on comm signals, life forms, and hazards within 1 kilometer. Operating a Sensor Pack requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, and grants a +5 circumstance bonus on your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks until the end of your next turn. </p>",
